        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the administration of all matters covered by this agreement, all parties are governed by existing or future law, by existing Government-wide regulations, by current Agency policies and regulations that do not conflict with this agreement, and by subsequently published agency policies and regulations required by law that are outside of the bargaining scope of the parties.",
